{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"KeyValueStore","kind":"identifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Sendable","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s8SendableP"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Apps inject a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"KeyValueStore"},{"text":" through their ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Environment"},{"text":", hydrate initial","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"state from it once at app start, and write to it from effects:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["\/\/ Environment","struct AppEnvironment: Sendable {","    var keyValue: any KeyValueStore","}","","\/\/ Hydration","extension AppState {","    static func hydrated(from store: any KeyValueStore) -> AppState {","        AppState(theme: store.value(.theme) ?? .system)","    }","}","","\/\/ Reducer + effect","case .themeChanged(let theme):","    state.theme = theme","    return { @Sendable _ in","        environment.keyValue.setValue(theme, for: .theme)","    }"]},{"type":"heading","text":"Hydration-only reads","anchor":"Hydration-only-reads","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Reads are intended for "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"hydration at app start","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":", not mid-cycle reads from"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reducers. UserDefaults itself is thread-safe, but a reducer reading while an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"effect writes creates ordering ambiguity. Reducers that need a preference"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"should read it once into state and then observe state."}]},{"type":"heading","tex